{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:daec938dc7ad0199f249d9084a96a1b2ac1d7227b408d5aa4518542d62c46b4e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65d0af65fa4da2f4b8c439b26fc05f338c4b5e540a95217eb0bbaf74b4c5125a",
      "text": "辛苦了，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aa58bf8eb1ac96d5fe787f9be5330efb2a87b293a07e129de63e2c3478cc3b5",
      "text": "突然打电话给你真抱歉呀。\n我就是想跟你道个谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae1efa86269997a986ba3e70799eb83c541fb9b84c857611ecfeab8e72689a0b",
      "text": "这次所有事情都能顺顺当当地成功，\n全靠制作人酱随机应变呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60aeab862712b0f57ed520958de71ac860862d6a3c6a7039b7b2ed06dc92ea65",
      "text": "谢谢你，制作人酱♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e662b35e61018f76635a5d3c376d67933f3b7ac295c1bc33723a978cd585b8e",
      "text": "你总是能好好听我讲，替我考虑对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5529da8f50d515dd7e4a6067b1e65a59d218c59d516a5961ef719adcc9dbb358",
      "text": "所以只要一冒出想做的事，\n我不知不觉就全跟你说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52e24dfcf5703485c589259761da7183bab08f0b3674dbfe8f8468125f6e079a",
      "text": "有时我也会想，自己是不是有点太依赖你了呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:019b5f6218b435354d0a3f12988e78b26848ac8e903342f00a1821445291ef0d",
      "text": "请别放在心上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:060e852b056af4e1544e108c45c32757dc0583e0f9e0560cac69763252a773c9",
      "text": "我只是做了自己\n力所能及的事而已！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_306_2_3_018_06_09_a:2_3_018_06_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b1c5a3810da2b520b32cd0b7557557fc457716fcb9cf0e22d975750e4d1f542",
      "text": "那我今后可要越来越依赖你啦。\n到时候也拜托你啰。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
